## Checklist for this class of bug

- [ ] Is output selection (JSON vs text) made at **one** exit point, or duplicated per branch?
- [ ] Does every exit-0 branch honor every output flag?
- [ ] Is the zero value a valid, fully-populated object (empty maps `{}`, no `null`, all keys present)?
- [ ] Do degraded/empty/absent tests assert the **machine** form, not just "output is non-empty"?
- [ ] Does the JSON path reuse the existing `MarshalJSON`, so no hand-built JSON can drift from the contract?
